<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THE FINAL ROUND OF LPGA CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THE FINAL ROUND OF LPGA CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Delaware 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the final round of the LPGA Championship on Sunday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>281 Chris Johnson 68 73 69 71 (Johnson won on the second playoff hole), Leta Lindley, 72 69 69 71</p>
<p>282 Annika Sorenstam (Sweden) 70 73 72 67</p>
<p>284 Laura Davies (Britain) 67 75 74 68, Sherri Steinhauer 68 71 73 72</p>
<p>285 Gail Graham 69 79 71 66, Dawn Coe-Jones (Canada) 70 75 71 69</p>
<p>286 Trish Johnson 70 73 72 71</p>
<p>287 Karrie Webb 71 79 70 67, Barb Mucha 68 73 72 74</p>
<p>288 Kelly Robbins 73 74 74 67, Pat Bradley 70 75 76 67, Brandie Burton 71 73 76 68, Dana Dormann 70 73 75 70, Judy Dickinson 75 72 68 73</p>
</text>
